subject = "Lil Car Accident order"
text = "What's up dawg? 
It's me the one and only **Lil Car Accident**. I wanted to reach out to you for a snowglobe cuz I just realeased my new album \"Accident in every Country\" and I hoped you could do a globe for me with the great wall of China to symbolize my new album, cuz I know how much I fw with shop. Maybe you can get me some orange or green into the base, that would be lit. I will pick it up today.

Thanks brother."
